    "description": "simple term lib.\r\n\r\n### Select\r\n\r\n```v\r\nimport sterm { Selection }\r\n\r\nfn main() {\r\n\tmut sel := Selection{\r\n\t\titems: ['a', 'b', 'c']\r\n\t\tidx: 0\r\n\t\thide_cursor: true\r\n\t}\r\n\tsel.draw()\r\n\tsel.run()\r\n\r\n\tprintln('You selected \"${sel.value()}\"')\r\n}\r\n```\r\n",
